<title>USA: O'Leary to meet lawmakers on heat oil at 1300 EST.</title>
<headline>O'Leary to meet lawmakers on heat oil at 1300 EST.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Energy Secretary Hazel O'Leary is scheduled to meet three Northeastern lawmakers Monday at 1300 EST/1800 GMT to discuss the heating oil market, said a spokeswoman for Rep. Joseph Kennedy, D-Mass.</p>
<p>O'Leary will meet Kennedy and Sens. Joseph Lieberman and Christopher Dodd, both Democrats from Connecticut, who last month asked the Energy Department to prevent a heating oil price shock this winter.</p>
